		{
			"id":"b_hub",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"✂️ Chunking Strategies\n& Text Splitting",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":840,
			"y":0,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#1abc9c"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_fixed",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Fixed-Size Chunking\n— char/token-based splits\n— chunk_size, chunk_overlap\n— Fast, predictable baseline\n— Risk: mid-sentence splits",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":840,
			"y":120,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#1abc9c"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_semantic",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 Semantic Chunking\n— Embed sentences, compare\n— Split at cosine drop threshold\n— SemanticChunker (LangChain)\n— Preserves topic coherence",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":840,
			"y":250,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#1abc9c"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_hierarchical",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 Hierarchical / Parent-Child\n— Child (128 tok): precision\n— Parent (512 tok): context fill\n— HierarchicalNodeParser\n— Small-to-big retrieval",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":840,
			"y":380,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#1abc9c"
		},
		{
			"id":"a_hub",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"📥 Ingestion &\nDocument Processing",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":410,
			"y":0,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#2ecc71"
		},
		{
			"id":"a_formats",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ File Format Parsers\n— PDF: pdfplumber layout-aware\n— HTML: BeautifulSoup stripping\n— DOCX: python-docx paragraphs\n— MD: header-aware extraction",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":410,
			"y":250,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#2ecc71"
		},
		{
			"id":"a_cleaning",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Document Cleaning\n— Strip headers, footers, pg#\n— Unicode normalization\n— Dedup identical paragraphs\n— Language detection/filter",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":410,
			"y":380,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#2ecc71"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_overlap",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Overlap Strategy\n— 10-20% overlap window\n— Boundary info preservation\n— Metadata: chunk_index,\n  prev_id, next_id links",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":840,
			"y":510,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#1abc9c"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_recursive",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Recursive Text Splitter\n— Priority separator list\n— ['\\n\\n','\\n',' ','']\n— LangChain default splitter\n— Respects paragraph structure",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":840,
			"y":640,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#1abc9c"
		},
		{
			"id":"b_docspecific",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Doc-Specific Splitters\n— MarkdownHeaderSplitter\n— HTMLHeaderTextSplitter\n— PythonCodeSplitter (AST)\n— LaTeX / JSON splitters",
			"styleAttributes":{},
