		{
			"id":"d_hnsw",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 HNSW Index\n— Hierarchical Navigable\nSmall World graph\n— M (connections), ef_construction\n— Sub-linear ANN search: O(log n)\n— Recall vs speed tradeoff",
