			"id":"d_ivf",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ IVF / IVFFlat / IVFPQ\n— Cluster-based Voronoi\n— nlist centroids, nprobe search\n— PQ: sub-vector codebooks\n— 4x memory compression",
