			"color":"#8e44ad"
		},
		{
			"id":"g_refrag",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ REFRAG\n— Reference-Filtered RAG\n— Pre-filter by citation quality\n— Trusted source weighting\n— Provenance-aware retrieval",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2990,
			"y":880,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"#16a085"
		},
		{
			"id":"f_hub",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🚀 Next-Gen RAG\nParadigms",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2560,
			"y":0,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#8e44ad"
		},
		{
			"id":"f_crag",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 Corrective RAG (CRAG)\n— Confidence-scored retrieval\n— Web search fallback trigger\n— Below-threshold: web search\n— Combine retrieved + web",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2560,
			"y":390,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#8e44ad"
		},
		{
			"id":"f_agentic",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 Agentic RAG / PlanRAG\n— LLM plans retrieval steps\n— Decomposes complex queries\n— Iterates until evidence full\n— Tool-calling retrieval loop",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2560,
			"y":520,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#8e44ad"
		},
		{
			"id":"f_selfrag",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 Self-RAG\n— Retrieval tokens (ISRET)\n— Relevance tokens (ISREL)\n— Support tokens (ISSUP)\n— End-to-end trained model",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2560,
			"y":120,
			"width":260,
			"height":110,
			"color":"#8e44ad"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_cohere",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Cohere Rerank API\n— co.rerank() endpoint\n— rerank-english-v3.0 model\n— Returns relevance scores\n— Drop-in reranker layer",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":670,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#c0392b"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_queryrew",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Query Rewriting\n— LLM-based reformulation\n— Step-back prompting\n— Query decomposition\n— Sub-query generation",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":910,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#c0392b"
		},
		{
			"id":"f_raft",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ RAFT\n— Retrieval-Augmented Fine-Tuning\n— Trained on distractor docs\n— Combines RAG + fine-tune\n— Domain-specific robustness",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2560,
			"y":900,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#8e44ad"
		},
		{
			"id":"f_cag",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ CAG\n— Cache-Augmented Generation\n— Pre-load docs into KV-cache\n— Zero retrieval latency\n— High memory cost tradeoff",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2560,
			"y":1000,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"#8e44ad"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_hyde",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ HyDE\n— Generate hypothetical answer\n— Embed the hypothesis\n— Retrieve similar docs\n— Bridges query-doc gap",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":1000,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"#c0392b"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_hub",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔍 Search Algorithms\n& Reranking Pipeline",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":0,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#c0392b"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_bm25",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ BM25 Sparse Retrieval\n— Best Match 25 algorithm\n— TF-IDF variant with saturation\n— Math: Σ IDF·(tf·(k+1))/(tf+k·(1-b+b·dl/avgdl))\n— Keyword exact match strength",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":120,
			"width":260,
			"height":120,
			"color":"#6c3483"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_dense",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Dense Retrieval\n— ANN over embedding index\n— bi-encoder architecture\n— DPR (Dense Passage Retrieval)\n— FAISS / Qdrant backend",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":270,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#c0392b"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_rrf",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 Reciprocal Rank Fusion\n— RRF(d) = Σ 1/(k+rank(d))\n— k=60 default constant\n— Merges sparse + dense lists\n— Parameter-free fusion",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":400,
			"width":260,
			"height":110,
			"color":"#6c3483"
		},
		{
			"id":"e_crossenc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 Cross-Encoder Reranking\n— Full attention: query+chunk\n— bi-directional relevance\n— 2nd-stage precision filter\n— Slower: used post-ANN",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":540,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#c0392b"
		},
		{
			"id":"p2_root",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"📚 PHASE 2\nAdvanced Retrieval\n& RAG Architectures",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-80,
			"y":370,
			"width":260,
			"height":110,
			"color":"#e67700"
		}
	],
